<title>USA: Value City August same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Value City August same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value City Department Stores Inc Thursday reported sales for the four weeks ended August 31, the first month of its fiscal year.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$83.8	$64.5     +29.9	 +1.6</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
